<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! realm.cabal.vouches ~ one hand's own standing, staked on one joiner

`lares cabal vouch <joiner-nym> --realm <id>` writes the acting face's vouch for one joiner onto the realm's vouch board: one hand, its own standing, no steward asked. It admits nobody; the voucher's score splits across everyone it vouches for, and the answer names the out-degree this replica sees as a floor. A repeat re-mints the one edge.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ vouch

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`vouch` params=`joiner/<joiner-nym> realm/0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef ~ vouch for one joiner`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ joiner · realm · nexus · face

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`joiner` params=`takes/nym needs/required seat/1 as/<joiner-nym> ~ the joiner's key, as lares cabal face prints it`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`realm` params=`takes/doc-id needs/required ~ the cabal-realm doc id, 64 hex`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`nexus` params=`takes/aid ~ the Nexus at this vessel's first act in the realm; the ledger keeps it after`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`face` params=`takes/index ~ the acting face, by persona index; absent, the one face standing open`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ seat

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`seat` params=`who/seat-or-hand key/face-at-nexus ~ the store door acts as the face, its key at the realm's Nexus`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ usage · CabalVouchError

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`usage` params=`cure/[[realm.cabal.vouches joiner/<joiner-nym> realm/0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef]] ~ vouch wants the joiner nym and --realm`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`CabalVouchError` params=`~ the vouch refused by name`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ vouched · refused

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`vouched` params=`exit/0 fields/[[voucherDid joiner realm boundEpoch boardUrl edgeId outDegreeFloor reMinted bundle]] ~ the vouch stands on the board`>>
<<has entity=`band` name=`refused` params=`exit/1 ~ refused by name`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

